{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0001", "text": "Let me refactor the login path in place, since it is the smallest change and the risk stays contained. However, tracing the actual call sites now, I think the session store is the real problem, so patching login would only hide it. We should fix the store first.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 103, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 48, "topic_id": "p05-auth-session-store", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0002", "text": "We can ship the migration during the Friday window if we keep the rollback script ready. Having said that, looking at the customer freeze calendar, a mid-week deploy is actually safer for this client. Let us move it to Tuesday.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 89, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 40, "topic_id": "p05-deploy-rollback", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
