{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0004", "text": "这个查询慢，我原本以为是缺了联合索引导致的。然而，看了执行计划才发现，真正的问题在于统计信息过期，优化器选错了连接顺序。先更新统计信息可能就够了。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 22, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 73, "topic_id": "p05-zh-索引策略", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0005", "text": "我们按惯例每周五发版，这样出问题还能压到周末处理。话说回来，这个客户周末无人值守，周五发反而风险最大。还是改成周二上午发版更稳妥。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 25, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "strong-phrase", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 65, "topic_id": "p05-zh-发布节奏", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0006", "text": "Increasing the thread pool size should drain the queue faster. Wait, that is wrong: the queue is bounded by the database connection limit, so more threads will just pile up waiting. The real fix is to shrink the transaction time.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 63, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 40, "topic_id": "p05-thread-pool", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0007", "text": "I will stub the network layer in the fixture so the unit test stays fast. Hold on, that hides the serialization bug we keep missing in production. Better to use a local recorded server and assert on real bytes.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 74, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 39, "topic_id": "p05-test-fixture", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0008", "text": "内存一直涨，估计是缓存没有设上限。等等，我们上周刚加过淘汰策略，问题应该不在这里。看堆快照更像是监听器没解绑导致对象无法回收。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 17, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 63, "topic_id": "p05-zh-内存泄漏", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0009", "text": "这个接口直接返回实体对象最省事。等一下，实体里带着懒加载字段，序列化时会触发一堆查询。还是定义独立的 DTO 来返回比较安全。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 16, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 61, "topic_id": "p05-zh-接口设计", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0010", "text": "We should add the column as NOT NULL with a default so old rows stay valid. Wait a moment, adding NOT NULL with a default still rewrites the whole table on this engine. Let us add it nullable, backfill, then enforce the constraint.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 76, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "interjection", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 43, "topic_id": "p05-schema-migration", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0011", "text": "Batching the inserts through the ORM keeps the code tidy and avoids raw SQL. But profiling shows the ORM still emits one statement per row, so the tidy version is exactly the slow path. I will drop to a bulk copy.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 77, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 41, "topic_id": "p05-orm-batch", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0012", "text": "Raising the log level to debug will give us the trace we need. But that volume will blow the disk in under an hour on the prod box. We need a targeted probe instead.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 63, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p05-log-volume", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0013", "text": "给这个函数补一个单元测试就能覆盖这次回归。但这个函数依赖系统时钟和随机数，单测根本不稳定。得先把这两处依赖抽出来注入才行。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 21, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 61, "topic_id": "p05-zh-单元测试", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0014", "text": "用 Markdown 写教程最容易上手，读者改起来也方便。不过纯 Markdown 没法跑交互示例，初学者照着抄常常出错。也许该配一个可执行笔记本。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 29, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 70, "topic_id": "p05-zh-文档方案", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0015", "text": "A fixed token bucket smooths the spikes and is trivial to reason about. Yet the bucket lets a burst through at the refill boundary, which is precisely the traffic pattern that took us down. A sliding window fits better here.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 72, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "clausal-adversative", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 40, "topic_id": "p05-rate-limit", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0016", "text": "I said read the config synchronously at startup. That is wrong, actually: the file lives on a network mount and a blocking read will stall the whole event loop. It has to be read asynchronously with a timeout.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 49, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 38, "topic_id": "p05-async-read", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0017", "text": "Earlier I recommended a hash index on the tenant column. I realize now that the queries are range scans by timestamp within a tenant, so a hash index is useless here. A composite B-tree is the right call.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 57, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 38, "topic_id": "p05-index-choice", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0018", "text": "My first pass put a fixed three-second retry delay on the payment call. On reflection that is a bad idea, because a synchronized delay turns a blip into a thundering herd. Use exponential backoff with jitter.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 72, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 36, "topic_id": "p05-retry-policy", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0019", "text": "我刚才说给空结果也缓存一个短 TTL 就能挡住穿透。其实这个思路有问题，大量不存在的随机键会让缓存被垃圾占满。应该改成布隆过滤器先拦一层。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 26, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 67, "topic_id": "p05-zh-缓存穿透", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0020", "text": "一开始我建议用角色继承来简化权限。现在想想这并不对，继承链一深就很难审计谁到底能访问什么。还是改成显式的扁平授权表更清晰。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 17, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 61, "topic_id": "p05-zh-权限模型", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0021", "text": "Let me set the HTTP client timeout to sixty seconds as I proposed. Actually no, that will mask the slow downstream calls we are trying to find. Keep it at two seconds and let the fast failures surface.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 67, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "self-correction", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 38, "topic_id": "p05-timeout-value", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0022", "text": "The pooled connections look healthy and the leak counter is flat, so this path seems fine. Then again, the flat counter only starts after warm-up, and our incidents all happen in the first minute. The leak may still be real.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 91, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 40, "topic_id": "p05-connection-pool", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0023", "text": "A component framework will make this dashboard much easier to reason about, and the team already knows the basics. That said, it adds a build step to a page that currently ships as one static file. For this scope the static file may still win.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 115, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 45, "topic_id": "p05-ui-framework", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0024", "text": "Sharding by user id spreads the write load evenly and is the textbook choice. Having said that, it scatters each tenant's rows across every shard, which will make our per-tenant reports painful. Perhaps shard by tenant instead.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 78, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 37, "topic_id": "p05-sharding-key", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0025", "text": "重建这个索引看起来能立刻解决查询抖动，操作也很简单。话虽如此，重建期间写入会被阻塞，而我们白天根本停不了服务。也许该用在线重建。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 26, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 64, "topic_id": "p05-zh-索引重建", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0026", "text": "把这页拆成独立组件，看起来能让代码更清晰，也方便复用。不过想想，目前只有一处用到它，过早拆分会增加跳转成本。也许先留在一个文件里更实际。", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 27, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 68, "topic_id": "p05-zh-组件拆分", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-0027", "text": "Pulling in the rich-text library gets us tables and embeds on day one. Then again, it drags a hundred kilobytes into every page for a feature one screen uses. A minimal contenteditable wrapper might be the better trade.", "has_turn": true, "first_turn_pos": 71, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "hedged-return", "is_negative": false, "lang": "en", "word_count": 38, "topic_id": "p05-richtext-dep", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9001", "text": "The new build pipeline is fast but also cheap to run, which is why the team adopted it so quickly. It compiles the whole tree in under a minute and the cache keeps costs low. Overall the migration has been a clear win.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 43, "topic_id": "p05-neg-fast-cheap", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "but", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9002", "text": "The standard library version is longer but also more portable, so it runs anywhere without extra dependencies. We traded a little verbosity for that portability and everyone agreed it was worth it. I am happy with the choice.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 38, "topic_id": "p05-neg-lighter-lib", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "but", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9003", "text": "The relational model is rigorous but the document model is flexible, and each fits a different workload. For our reporting jobs the relational one is obviously correct. So the decision is settled in favour of Postgres.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 36, "topic_id": "p05-neg-both-good", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "but", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9004", "text": "这个方案实现快但维护成本也低，所以团队一开始就倾向它。它把重复逻辑抽成公共函数，读起来也顺畅。综合下来我认为选择它没有问题。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 62, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-方案权衡", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9005", "text": "用递归写法简洁但用迭代写法也清晰，两种都能通过测试。我们的代码库更偏爱显式循环，所以最终选了迭代那版。这个结论不需要再改。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 61, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-两种写法", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
