{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9007", "text": "Install the package with the standard command and you are ready to go. However, there is an offline mirror for air-gapped machines documented in the appendix. For most readers the standard command is all they need.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 36, "topic_id": "p05-neg-footnote", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "However, there is an offline", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
