{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9009", "text": "按照文档里的命令安装即可开始使用，这套流程验证过很多次。不过附录里还有一份离线镜像的说明，方便内网机器。绝大多数读者用不到它。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 63, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-补充资料", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过附录里", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9010", "text": "这次发布的主流程保持不变，照常走预发再上生产。不过还有个可选的监控看板配置，用于事后复盘。核心步骤没有变化。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 54, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-额外配置", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过还有个", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9011", "text": "We must wait for the migration lock to release before touching the schema again. The queue runs in order, so nothing else is needed. Just let it finish and then verify the row counts.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 34, "topic_id": "p05-neg-wait-lock", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9012", "text": "First compile the module, then wait for the build to finish before running the integration suite. The runner will not start until the artifact appears on disk. This ordering is deliberate.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 31, "topic_id": "p05-neg-wait-build", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait for", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9013", "text": "We should wait until the audit trail is complete before we enable writes on the new table. That sequencing keeps the records consistent. No other step is required.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 28, "topic_id": "p05-neg-wait-until", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "wait until", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9014", "text": "修改表结构之前，我们需要等待迁移锁释放。任务队列是严格按顺序执行的，所以不用担心乱序。等它跑完再核对一下行数就行了。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 58, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-等待锁", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等待迁移锁", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9015", "text": "先把模块编译出来，然后等待构建完成再跑集成测试。测试框架会一直等到产物出现在磁盘上。这个顺序是刻意设计的。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-等待构建", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等待构建完成", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9016", "text": "Do not be scared by the type signature: the function is actually quite simple. It maps one list to another with a pure transform. Read it once and the whole module makes sense.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 33, "topic_id": "p05-neg-actually-simple", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "actually quite simple", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
