{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9018", "text": "这个参数其实是可选的，默认值就是开启状态，日常调用几乎不用传。绝大多数地方都用最简写法，实现本身也没什么特别的。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 56, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-其实是默认", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实是可选", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
