{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9020", "text": "把水果、蔬菜、谷物等食材按类别放进不同的篮子，是一道常见的编程练习题。它主要考察的是分组和遍历。数据规模很小，用哈希表就够了。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 63, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-水果等", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9021", "text": "这个模块负责日志、指标、告警等功能，对外只暴露几个稳定接口。内部实现经常调整，调用方不受影响。目录结构也按这个边界来组织。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 61, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-接口等", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9022", "text": "上线前要准备好回滚脚本、监控看板、值班名单等要素。这些是发布检查表里的固定项。按清单逐条确认即可。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 49, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-清单等", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9023", "text": "这个报错看着吓人，其实不过是个日志格式的小问题。程序的逻辑完全正常，只是输出时少了个空格。改一行字符串就解决了。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 56, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-不过小问题", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过是个日志", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9024", "text": "项目延期并不是能力不够，不过是个时间安排的问题。人手和方案都没问题，只要把排期重新拉一遍就行。所以不用调整方向。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 56, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-不过时间问题", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过是个时间", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9025", "text": "关于缓存的命中率，其实是这样的：热点数据会被优先保留，冷数据自然淘汰。这个机制一直如此，并不是缺陷。理解这点后行为就很好解释了。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 64, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-其实是这样", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实是这样的", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9026", "text": "对比两个版本的性能，其实差异并不来自算法，而是编译选项不同。代码逻辑几乎一样。所以结论是保持原实现即可。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 52, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-其实没变", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实差异并不来自", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
