{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9033", "text": "这个工具函数基本可用，加上空值判断就能覆盖文档里列出的所有情况。虽然略显啰嗦，但完全够用。不需要再动它。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 52, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-基本可用", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "基本可用", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9034", "text": "To summarise: the root cause is the missing index, the mitigation is to add it in the next window, and the fix is already reviewed. Nothing about that plan needs to change. We proceed as agreed.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 36, "topic_id": "p05-neg-summary-fix", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "To summarise", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9035", "text": "总结一下：根因是缺少索引，缓解办法是在下个窗口补上，修复方案也已经评审通过。整个计划没有需要调整的地方。按原定方案推进即可。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 62, "topic_id": "p05-neg-zh-总结", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "总结一下", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9036", "text": "So to recap, we covered modules, imports, and the build step today. Next session continues with testing and packaging. There is nothing here to unlearn before we move on.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 29, "topic_id": "p05-neg-recap", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "So to recap", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "p05-8db71d8b-9037", "text": "The dataset is small yet well curated, which is exactly what a first experiment needs. Quality beats raw size at this stage. So we proceed with it as the training set.", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "en", "word_count": 31, "topic_id": "p05-neg-yet-same", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "8db71d8b-c699-4d31-b504-0feb7d6fc888", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "yet well curated", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
